{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37238","headline":"寄江东道友 · 章谒","name":"寄江东道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野亭歌罢指西秦，避俗争名兴各新。\n碧带黄麻呈缥缈，短竿长线弄因循。\n夜潮分卷三江月，晓骑齐驱九陌尘。\n可惜人间好声势，片帆羸马不相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}